  "details": "The loading screen music is currently tied to the UI/Menu volume slider. Lowering the UI volume to silence the loading music also mutes important sounds like the Camera shutter and menu interaction feedback.\n\nThis is so so annoying - the vibe is completely killed when launching the game or loading a world while I'm already listening to external songs.\n\nPlease add a separate volume slider specifically for the loading screen music. This would allow players to turn it off without affecting other crucial UI sounds.",
